 "_format": "Hand-written grammar course. In 'choice', 'quiz' and 'meaning' items the FIRST option is the right one (the app shuffles). 'build' tiles are the Korean split on spaces plus 'extra' wrong tiles. Formula chips are 'text|caption'. Drills generate conjugation or particle questions from the word list.",
